  "description": "VOLMUF crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group F d d d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H90 Al4 O7 Yb4,C7 H8. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1B (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1F (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb1D (Yb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.127-4.172 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.68-140.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C34H90Al4O7Yb4·C7H8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
